{
  "id": "survival-generic-pickup-dropped-item",
  "notes": "Drop a create:andesite_alloy with Q, then walk onto the drop to pick it up again. TRUTH: the dropped item lands in front of the player (about 1-2 blocks along +z); walking over it picks it up, so the inventory returns to 3 alloy. The landing cell is not verified (collect walks to 308,121,310).",
